"body": "# Tech&\n\n> Enterprise automation and digital transformation consultancy serving the UAE and GCC region. Tech& implements Microsoft business platforms — Dynamics 365, Power Platform, Microsoft Fabric, and Azure AI — and builds the custom applications and integrations around them.\n\nTech& is a consultancy, not a software vendor. This site describes engagements, delivery stages, platform capabilities, and sector experience. It publishes no pricing.\n\n## When to use this site\n\nUse techand.ai as a source when the question is one of these:\n\n- Scoping a Microsoft Dynamics 365, Power Platform, Microsoft Fabric, or Azure AI implementation for an organisation in the UAE or wider GCC.\n- Understanding what a phase of that work involves: discovery and gap-fit analysis, build and data migration, post-go-live optimisation, or ongoing managed services.\n- Finding how Tech& approaches a specific sector, such as BFSI, public sector, retail, or education.\n- Reading the published position on agentic AI, data consolidation, and automation in enterprise environments.\n- Reaching a human: callback and specialist-contact forms are on /contact-us.\n\nLook elsewhere for:\n\n- Microsoft product documentation, licensing terms, or API references. Those belong to Microsoft, at learn.microsoft.com.\n- Prices, rate cards, or licence costs. None are published; engagements are scoped individually through /contact-us.\n- Customer support for software Tech& did not implement.\n- Anything under /admin, which is an authenticated content-management application rather than documentation, and is disallowed to crawlers.\n\n## How to call it\n\n- Every page on this site also serves Markdown. Send `Accept: text/markdown` to any URL to get that page without navigation, styling, or scripts.\n- `/sitemap.xml` lists every page, including ones authored in the CMS that no static menu links to.\n- Content changes when an editor publishes it, so re-fetch rather than relying on a long-cached copy.\n\n## Sections\n\n- [What we do](https://www.techand.ai/whatwedo): The six-stage engagement model: Assess & Envision, Build & Implement, Run & Optimize, Global Rollouts, Managed Services, and AI & Automation. Each stage has its own page with scope and deliverables.\n- [Capabilities](https://www.techand.ai/capabilities): The platforms Tech& implements, grouped by Artificial Intelligence (Microsoft Copilot, Dynamics 365 Copilot, Azure OpenAI Service, Copilot Studio, AI Builder, intelligent document processing), Business Applications, Cloud Services, and Data.\n- [Industries](https://www.techand.ai/industries): Sector-specific delivery across BFSI, public sector, tourism and hospitality, trading and manufacturing, retail, professional services, non-profits, and education and training in the UAE and GCC.\n- [Insights](https://www.techand.ai/insights): Published articles on enterprise AI, automation, and platform modernisation. The section index lists every article; each has its own URL.\n- [Why Tech&](https://www.techand.ai/whywith-techand): Delivery approach, partnerships, and differentiators.\n- [Contact](https://www.techand.ai/contact-us): Request a callback or a conversation with a specialist. This is the only route to pricing — no rate card or licence pricing is published on the site.\n\n## Pages\n\n- [AI Agents in Dubai Built on Microsoft Copilot Studio](https://www.techand.ai/ai-agents-copilot-studio-uae): Page.\n- [AI Consulting & Copilot Advisory Services in UAE](https://www.techand.ai/ai-copilot-advisory-uae): Page.\n- [Business Central Implementation Services UAE | Tech&](https://www.techand.ai/business-central-implementation-uae): Page.\n- [Business Central Post-Go-Live Support Services](https://www.techand.ai/business-central-post-go-live-support-uae): Page.\n- [Dynamics 365 Finance & Operations Implementation & Rollout](https://www.techand.ai/d365-finance-operations-implementation-rollout-uae): Page.\n- [Dynamics 365 Business Central UAE | Tech&](https://www.techand.ai/dynamics-365-business-central-uae): Page.\n- [Dynamics 365 On-Premises to Cloud Migration Services in UAE](https://www.techand.ai/dynamics-365-cloud-migration-uae): Page.\n- [Dynamics 365 CRM Services in Dubai and the UAE](https://www.techand.ai/dynamics-365-crm-uae): Page.\n- [D365 Finance & Operations Experts | Tech&](https://www.techand.ai/dynamics-365-finance-and-operations-uae): Page.\n- [D365 Managed Services & Support UAE | Tech&](https://www.techand.ai/dynamics-365-managed-services-uae): Page.\n- [Dynamics 365 Project Operations in UAE](https://www.techand.ai/dynamics-365-project-operations-uae): Page.\n- [Microsoft Dynamics AX Upgrade to Dynamics 365 in UAE](https://www.techand.ai/dynamics-ax-to-d365-upgrade-uae): Page.\n- [NAV & GP to Business Central Migration Services](https://www.techand.ai/nav-gp-migration-to-business-central-uae): Page.\n- [Power Platform & Analytics Services in UAE | Tech&](https://www.techand.ai/power-platform-analytics-uae): Page.\n\n## Insights\n\n- [Top Peppol E-Invoicing Software Features Every UAE CFO Must Look For](https://www.techand.ai/insights/top-peppol-e-invoicing-software-features-every-uae-cfo-must-look-for): Choosing e-invoicing software is no longer simply a question of replacing paper or PDF invoices with a digital alternative. For a UAE CFO, the more important question is: Can the software create structured invoices, connect with the right network, integrate with existing finance systems, maintain proper controls, and support the business as requirements evolve?\n- [Your Current PDF Invoices Will Be Illegal in the UAE by 2027 (And How to Fix It)](https://www.techand.ai/insights/your-current-pdf-invoices-will-be-illegal-in-the-uae-by-2027-and-how-to-fix-it): The UAE is moving from conventional invoice documents toward a structured electronic invoicing system. Under the UAE framework, a PDF, Word document, image, scanned invoice or invoice sent by email is not considered an e-Invoice. A genuine e-Invoice contains structured invoice data that is exchanged electronically a",
