"body": "# Value Driven Innovation through Automation\n\nTech& helps GCC enterprises move beyond the limits of traditional CRM & ERP software.\n\n[Read More about Value Driven Innovation through Automation](https://www.techand.ai/insights/value-driven-innovation-automation)[Talk to Sales](https://www.techand.ai/contact-us)\n\n## Empowering enterprise transformation through cutting-edge technology\n\nChoosing the right partner is the most important step for your company's future technology goals. We bring together a massive team of experts and significant financial backing to ensure your project succeeds on time. Our work across many different GCC industries proves that we understand how to solve complex business problems with smart AI tools. You can trust our experts to deliver modern Microsoft solutions that keep your business running smoothly every single day.\n\n## 20+ Years\n\nProven industry experience\n\n## Strong Client Base\n\nDelivered in multiple industries\n\n## Global Partner\n\nWorldwide collaboration reach\n\n## Industries We Serve\n\nFix core business challenges using secure enterprise technology that delivers measurable results.\n\n[\n\n### Banking & Financial Services\n\nSecure compliant systems for regulated financial operations\n\n](https://www.techand.ai/industries#bfsi)[\n\n### Public Sector\n\nDigital platforms for transparent and efficient governance\n\n](https://www.techand.ai/industries#public-sector)[\n\n### Education & Training\n\nStreamlined education management and data driven insights\n\n](https://www.techand.ai/industries#education)[\n\n### Tourism & Hospitality\n\nSmart systems enhancing guest experience and operations\n\n](https://www.techand.ai/industries#hospitality)[\n\n### Trading & Manufacturing\n\nConnected supply chains are improving production and visibility\n\n](https://www.techand.ai/industries#manufacturing)[\n\n### Retail\n\nUnified commerce delivering better customer experiences\n\n](https://www.techand.ai/industries#retail)[\n\n### Professional Services\n\nProcess driven systems for service focused firms\n\n](https://www.techand.ai/industries#professional-services)[\n\n### Non Profit\n\nTechnology enabling impact transparency and growth\n\n](https://www.techand.ai/industries#nonprofit)\n\n## What We Do\n\nWe guide your business through every step of technology growth to ensure you stay ahead of competitors.\n\n### Assess & Envision\n\nWe analyze your current business challenges and develop a comprehensive plan to achieve your future technology objectives.\n\n[Learn more about Assess & Envision](https://www.techand.ai/whatwedo#assess-envision)\n\n### Build & Implement\n\nOur team develops your custom software and installs the right Microsoft tools to make your work easier.\n\n[Learn more about Build & Implement](https://www.techand.ai/whatwedo#build-implement)\n\n### Run & Optimize\n\nWe keep your systems moving quickly and continually find new ways to enhance the performance of your digital tools.\n\n[Learn more about Run & Optimize](https://www.techand.ai/whatwedo#run-optimize)\n\n### Global Rollouts\n\nWe take your business solutions and launch them safely across different countries and many new office locations.\n\n[Learn more about Global Rollouts](https://www.techand.ai/whatwedo#global-rollouts)\n\n### Managed Services\n\nOur experts handle your daily IT needs, allowing your staff to focus on major projects without technical stress.\n\n[Learn more about Managed Services](https://www.techand.ai/whatwedo#managed-services)\n\n### AI & Automation\n\nDeliver measurable outcomes using AI agents, intelligent automation, and data-driven insights across enterprise workflows...\n\n[Learn more about AI & Automation](https://www.techand.ai/whatwedo#ai-automation)\n\n## Microsoft-Aligned Enterprise Excellence\n\nAs a trusted Microsoft partner, we deliver world-class solutions that drive digital transformation and business growth across the GCC region.\n\n### Proven Track Record\n\nDelivering enterprise success\n\n### Regional Expertise\n\nDeep UAE & GCC knowledge\n\n### 24/7 Support\n\nAlways here when you need us\n\n![Capabilities Icon](https://www.techand.ai/capabilities.svg?dpl=dpl_93FSv7vnUxYifyLCSYQTkua26DkJ)\n\n## Tech& Capabilities\n\nEnterprise platforms, AI, and integration services\n\nAIBusiness ApplicationsCloud ServicesData\n\n![Microsoft Copilot for Microsoft 365](https://www.techand.ai/icons/microsoft-copilot.svg?dpl=dpl_93FSv7vnUxYifyLCSYQTkua26DkJ)\n\n### Microsoft Copilot for Microsoft 365\n\nSmart tools built into Microsoft 365 make writing, analyzing data, and completing work tasks faster and easier for teams.\n\n[Learn more about Microsoft Copilot for Microsoft 365](https://www.techand.ai/capabilities#microsoft-copilot-m365)\n\n![Dynamics 365 Copilot](https://www.techand.ai/icons/Dynamics365_scalable.svg?dpl=dpl_93FSv7vnUxYifyLCSYQTkua26DkJ)\n\n### Dynamics 365 Copilot\n\nAI assistance is built right into sales, finance, customer service, and supply chain programs.\n\n[Learn more about Dynamics 365 Copilot](https://www.techand.ai/capabilities#dynamics-365-copilot)\n\n![Azure OpenAI Service](https://www.techand.ai/icons/azure/03438-icon-service-Azure-OpenAI.svg?dpl=dpl_93FSv7vnUxYifyLCSYQTkua26DkJ)\n\n### Azure OpenAI Service\n\nSafe access to advanced AI technology that companies can use to build smart applications for their business needs.\n\n[Learn more about Azure OpenAI Service](https://www.techand.ai/capabilities#azure-openai-service)\n\n![Copilot Studio](https://www.techand.ai/icons/CopilotStudio_scalable.svg?dpl=dpl_93FSv7vnUxYifyLCSYQTkua26DkJ)\n\n### Copilot Studio\n\nTools that let businesses create their own AI helpers and chatbots designed specifically for how their company works.\n\n[Learn more about Copilot Studio](https://www.techand.ai/capabilities#copilot-studio)\n\n![AI Builder](https://www.techand.ai/icons/AIBuilder_scalable.svg?dpl=dpl_93FSv7vnUxYifyLCSYQTkua26DkJ)\n\n### AI Builder\n\nSimple, no-coding-required AI tools that can make predictions, handle documents, and process information automatically.\n\n[Learn more about AI Builder](https://www.techand.ai/capabilities#ai-builder)\n\n![Azure A",
